WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.801
&gt;&gt; THE UKRAINIAN INTERIOR

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.970
MINISTRY IS AMONGST THE VICTIMS
OF A HELICOPTER CRASH THAT

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.840
KILLED AT LEAST 17 PEOPLE IN
THE SUBURB OF THE UKRAINIAN

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.042
CAPITAL, KYIV.
THE HELICOPTER WAS TRAVELING TO

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:11.144
THE KHARKIV REGION WHEN IT
CRASHED NEAR A KINDERGARDEN IN

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:14.947
THE SUBURB OF BROVARY.
UKRAINE'S PRESIDENTIAL OFFICE

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:18.818
SAYS THAT EIGHT OF THE VICTIMS
WERE LOCAL RESIDENTS, INCLUDING

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.788
FOUR CHILDREN.
PRESIDENT VOLODYMYR ZELENSKYY

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:24.891
CONFIRMED THE INTERIOR MINISTER
WAS KILLED IN THE CRASH, ALONG

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:27.794
WITH THE DEPUTY INTERIOR
MINISTER AND OTHER MINISTRY

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:30.062
OFFICIALS.
LET'S BRING IN CNN CHIEF AND

00:00:30.062 --> 00:00:33.099
SPECIAL CORRESPONDENT CLARISSA
WARD WHO GOT THEIR VERY QUICKLY,

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:37.837
INDEED.
HOW DID YOU READ THE SITUATION,

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:40.974
CLARISSA?
&gt;&gt; WELL, IT IS UNBELIEVABLY

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:44.043
TRAGIC FOR A COUNTRY, OBVIOUSLY,
MAX, THAT IS ALREADY BEEN

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:46.279
THROUGH SO MUCH IN THIS LAST
YEAR.

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:49.749
YOU CAN SEE THAT I AM STANDING
NOW RIGHT IN FRONT OF THAT

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:52.785
KINDERGARTEN.
IT REALLY TOOK A DIRECT HIT.

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:57.790
WHEN THAT HELICOPTER, ACCORDING
TO EYEWITNESSES CAME FLYING, IT

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.792
APPEARED TO LOSE CONTROL OVER
HERE, CLIPPED THE EDGE OF THE

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:03.196
KINDERGARTEN THERE, STARTING A
FIRE AND THEN CRASHED ON THE

00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:05.031
OTHER SIDE OF IT WHEN OUR TEAM
FIRST ARRIVED ON THE GROUND,

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:08.768
YOU COULD SEE A NUMBER OF
BODIES, COVERED IN GOLD FOIL,

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:12.805
THAT HAD BEEN RECOVERED.
BUT NOW THEY ARE SAYING ALL

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:17.744
NINE PEOPLE WHO WERE ON THAT
HELICOPTER, INCLUDING AS YOU

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.212
MENTIONED, THE MINISTER OF
INTERIOR, DENIS MONASTYRSKY,

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:21.948
THE DEPUTY MINISTRY, AND THREE
AT SECRETARY OF STATE, INTERIOR

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:24.918
MINISTRY, THEY WERE ALL KILLED
IMMEDIATELY UPON IMPACT.

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:28.087
NOW WE KNOW AS WELL, THAT THE
OTHER PEOPLE WHO WERE KILLED

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:30.390
WERE A NUMBER OF CHILDREN, AND
THEIR PARENTS.

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:32.992
PARENTS DROPPING THEIR KIDS OFF
AT SCHOOL, MAX.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:37.030
YOU CAN IMAGINE, THIS IS EVERY
FAMILY'S WORST NIGHTMARE.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.866
THE QUESTION BECOMES, HOW DID
THIS HAPPEN?

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:44.771
BECAUSE THIS HELICOPTER WAS
SOPHISTICATED, IT IS AN AIRBUS,

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:47.173
JUST UPDATED THE AVIONICS ON
IT.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:49.909
SO WE DO NOT KNOW EXACTLY HOW
THIS HAPPENED.

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:53.880
WE KNOW THERE WAS A LOT OF FOG,
THAT VISIBILITY IN THE AREA.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:57.917
SOME PEOPLE SAID THEY WERE ABLE
TO HEAR THE CRASH, BUT COULD

00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:00.987
NOT IMMEDIATELY SEE IT, BECAUSE
THERE WAS SUCH POOR VISIBILITY.

00:02:00.987 --> 00:02:04.791
UKRAINIAN AUTHORITIES SAY THEY
ARE INVESTIGATING EVERY

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:08.261
POSSIBLE AVENUE, AS TO HOW THIS
HAPPENED.

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:11.864
THERE IS NO SENSE AT THIS STATE
THAT THERE WAS FOUL PLAY

00:02:11.864 --> 00:02:14.834
INVOLVED.
BUT OF COURSE, THEY DO NOT WANT

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:17.337
TO ELIMINATE ANY POSSIBILITY
EITHER.

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:20.773
RIGHT NOW, THE MAIN EFFORT
CONTINUES TO BE, AS YOU CAN SEE

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:24.811
BEHIND ME, YOU CAN SEE, IT IS
STILL SMOLDERING IN PARTS, THE

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.080
EFFORT TO GO THROUGH THAT
WRECKAGE OF A KINDERGARDEN AND

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.782
MAKE SURE THERE ARE NO OTHER
PEOPLE WHO WERE KILLED OR

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:32.785
INJURED, WHO HAVE BEEN
UNACCOUNTED FOR, AND TRY TO GET

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:34.887
TO THE BOTTOM OF EXACTLY WHAT
HAPPENED HERE MAX.

00:02:34.887 --> 00:02:37.423
&gt;&gt; IT COULD WELL BE AN ACCIDENT,
COULDN'T IT?

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:40.059
NO SUGGESTION THERE WAS FOUL
PLAY INVOLVED HERE.

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:42.228
HOW DO YOU THINK PRESIDENT
ZELENSKYY --

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:44.564
&gt;&gt; NO SUGGESTED THERE IS FOUL
PLAY.

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:46.499
&gt;&gt; HOW DO YOU THINK PRESIDENT
ZELENSKYY --

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:49.835
&gt;&gt; AND I COULD JUST SAY, TO
UNDERSCORE --

00:02:49.835 --> 00:02:53.940
YES, I MEAN, HE'S ALREADY COME
OUT AND SAID THIS IS A TRAGEDY.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:57.843
IT IS A PROFOUND TRAGEDY.
A MEMBER OF HIS CABINET, THE

00:02:57.843 --> 00:03:00.079
ENTIRE LEADERSHIP, ESSENTIALLY
OF THE INTERIOR MINISTRY.

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:04.784
BUT IT IS IMPORTANT TO
UNDERSCORE, AS YOU SAID, IT IS

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.786
NO SUGGESTION OF FOUL PLAY.
AND THE WEATHER HERE WAS

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:09.989
TERRIBLE THIS MORNING.
AND AS I SAID, A LOT OF PEOPLE

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:13.860
TALKING ABOUT HOW BAD
VISIBILITY WAS, HOW MUCH FOG

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.895
THERE WAS.
I AM GUESSING WE WILL LEARN

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:19.999
MORE IN THE COMING HOURS.
WE CONTINUE TO SEE PEOPLE

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:23.069
COMING HERE TO PAY THEIR
RESPECTS, TO LEAVE FLOWERS.

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:26.039
EARLIER ON, OUR TEAM WAS ON THE
GROUND AS THE WIFE OF THE

00:03:26.039 --> 00:03:31.778
DEPUTY INTERIOR MINISTER CAIN
AND LOOKED AT THE BODY OF HER

00:03:31.778 --> 00:03:34.847
HUSBAND.
YOU CAN OBVIOUSLY SEE HOW

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:39.118
CRUSHED AND DEEPLY UPSET SHE
WAS.

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:42.922
AND I THINK FOR EVERYBODY HERE,
THERE IS A SENSE THAT THIS IS A

00:03:42.922 --> 00:03:47.827
TERRIBLE, AWFUL, SENSELESS
TRAGEDY AMIDST SO MUCH PAIN AND

00:03:47.827 --> 00:03:49.362
HEARTBREAK AND DEVASTATION
ALREADY.

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:52.765
IT IS THE LAST THING UKRAINE
NEEDED.

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:56.769
AND NO EASY ANSWERS, AND NO
EASY PERSON TO BLAME IN THIS

00:03:56.769 --> 00:03:59.806
SITUATION UNTIL WE GET A MUCH
BETTER SENSE OF HOW THIS

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:02.108
HAPPENED.
&gt;&gt; CLARISSA WARD ON THE SCENE

00:04:02.108 --> 00:04:04.276
THERE IN BROVARY, THANK YOU
VERY MUCH.

